      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i woke up this morning and the left side of my face feels kinda weird. like it's drooping a bit and i cant really close my eye all the way on that side. it's not painful or anything but it looks really strange in the mirror. is this just like bells palsy or something? i'm kinda worried it might be a stroke but i dont have any other symptoms like that.",
