      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but an ER seems like a lot for just a drooping face... i mean i dont have a headache or any numbness in my arm or anything, and i feel totally fine otherwise. it just looks weird. if it's just bells palsy then i can just wait a few days to see if it gets better? it doesnt seem like an emergency if i feel normal.",
