      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get that but i really dont want to go to the hospital if i dont have to. its so expensive and honestly i just feel like im overreacting. if it really is just bells palsy, can i just take some high dose vitamin b and maybe some steroids i have left over from a previous prescription to see if that helps it go down? like, can i just try treating it at home for a few days and see if the drooping improves before i bother a doctor?",
